(Company Employment Rules - 2026 Edition) Tj T*
(======================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chapter 1: General Provisions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 1 \(Purpose\)) Tj T*
(These rules govern the working conditions of employees at our company.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 2 \(Scope of Application\)) Tj T*
(These rules apply to all regular employees of the company.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 3 \(Compliance\)) Tj T*
(Employees must comply with these rules and company policies.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chapter 2: Working Hours) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 4 \(Working Hours\)) Tj T*
(Standard working hours: 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM) Tj T*
(Break time: 1 hour \(12:00 PM to 1:00 PM\)) Tj T*
(Actual working hours: 8 hours per day) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 5 \(Overtime\)) Tj T*
(Overtime work requires prior approval from department manager.) Tj T*
(Overtime pay is calculated at 125% of regular hourly rate.) Tj T*
(Late-night overtime after 10 PM: 150% of regular rate.) Tj T*
ET
