(Chapter 3: Leave and Vacation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 6 \(Annual Paid Leave\)) Tj T*
(Employees are granted paid leave as follows:) Tj T*
(  Less than 1 year of service: 10 days) Tj T*
(  1 year of service: 11 days) Tj T*
(  2 years of service: 12 days) Tj T*
(  3 years of service: 14 days) Tj T*
(  4 years of service: 16 days) Tj T*
(  5 years of service: 18 days) Tj T*
(  6 or more years: 20 days \(maximum\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 7 \(Special Leave\)) Tj T*
(Marriage leave: 5 days) Tj T*
(Bereavement leave - spouse or child: 5 days) Tj T*
(Bereavement leave - parent: 3 days) Tj T*
(Bereavement leave - sibling or grandparent: 1 day) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 8 \(Childcare Leave\)) Tj T*
(Employees may take childcare leave until the child reaches age 1.) Tj T*
(Extension up to age 2 is possible if daycare is unavailable.) Tj T*
(Application must be submitted at least 1 month in advance.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
