(Chapter 4: Salary and Benefits) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 9 \(Salary Payment\)) Tj T*
(Salary is paid on the 25th of each month.) Tj T*
(If the 25th falls on a holiday, payment is made the previous business day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 10 \(Allowances\)) Tj T*
(Commuting allowance: actual cost up to 50,000 yen per month) Tj T*
(Housing allowance: 20,000 yen per month for non-homeowners) Tj T*
(Family allowance: 10,000 yen per dependent) Tj T*
(Position allowance: determined by job grade) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 11 \(Bonus\)) Tj T*
(Bonuses are paid twice a year: June and December.) Tj T*
(Bonus amount is determined based on company performance and evaluation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 12 \(Retirement Benefits\)) Tj T*
(Employees with 3 or more years of service are eligible for retirement pay.) Tj T*
(Calculation: monthly salary x years of service x coefficient) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chapter 5: Disciplinary Rules) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Article 13 \(Disciplinary Actions\)) Tj T*
(Verbal warning, written warning, suspension, demotion, or dismissal.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
